<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services recently received an application fee waiver from your school. However, I do not see an application for admission to Arizona State University on file for you.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Please <a href="http://asu.edu/apply">submit your application</a> as soon as possible. When asked to pay the application fee, select the Pay Later option. Your waiver will then be applied to your application.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">If you haven't applied to ASU yet because you are undecided about your major, use our <a href="http://asu.edu/degrees">degree search tool</a> to search for a major based on your favorite subject, career interests or keywords. If you are still undecided, choose one of our Exploratory programs.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: Times;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Pone__c}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>